              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "drbecca"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My Polish MIL makes this often, but she doubles the amount of pasta and skips the condensed soup. She also tosses it all together in a baking dish and bakes it for 30 mintues at 350 degrees. 4 stars for her version. 2 stars for this one.",
            "datePublished": "2011-01-01T13:13:18.890Z"
